report_rules.lerta:20:4: put the items of a list that does not fit on lines of their own (Long lists)
report_rules.lerta:22:7: put the items of a list that does not fit on lines of their own (Long lists)
report_rules.lerta:26:6: write an arm of one statement on its line, and `else if` for an `else` of one `if` (Branches)
report_rules.lerta:33:12: put one space here, or none (Spacing)
report_rules.lerta:41:5: write an arm of one statement on its line, and `else if` for an `else` of one `if` (Branches)
report_rules.lerta:46:11: drop the parentheses that change nothing, or add those that clarify (Parentheses)
report_rules.lerta:51:96: write one statement in the postfix form if it fits, and otherwise in a block (Postfix forms)
report_rules.lerta:57:16: write an arm of one statement on its line, and `else if` for an `else` of one `if` (Branches)
